{"steam_appid":2461280,"steam_name":"Lessaria: Fantasy Kingdom Sim","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2461280/865983942/1d3cde42ec7432a984db40b3b14ba25360cc05fb/1758455992/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760953660","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203241/9fd4359a90b4227665f0316cbaaefee3f5aba285/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760953660","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/87045a9f2e2ad2bbd52840a90ffd54a96efab19b/ss_87045a9f2e2ad2bbd52840a90ffd54a96efab19b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785339330","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/98b2f268113a6e77a9ff6957bb59432c27911419/ss_98b2f268113a6e77a9ff6957bb59432c27911419.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785339330","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/89416e3b11f2ed2d2a978ac4137cc07334c7e9d4/ss_89416e3b11f2ed2d2a978ac4137cc07334c7e9d4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785339330","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/7a832d088c4f7f9e3a739670c214862113917c6c/ss_7a832d088c4f7f9e3a739670c214862113917c6c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785339330","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/fe992257fbe88b7648ed7ccc5205e51d0c15efb1/ss_fe992257fbe88b7648ed7ccc5205e51d0c15efb1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785339330"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lessaria is the spiritual successor to Majesty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/ad04bb41b5cefc00c7ad10e452c694c2.poster.avif?t=1785339330\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/ad04bb41b5cefc00c7ad10e452c694c2.webm?t=1785339330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're bringing back the RTS genre with indirect control. You build a kingdom, hire heroes, and they live their own lives, doing whatever they please. Try winning a battle with such an unpredictable army!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New ideas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/cba56e9cc0f4a06a90a5ebf57d60220c.poster.avif?t=1785339330\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/cba56e9cc0f4a06a90a5ebf57d60220c.webm?t=1785339330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're not creating a clone — we're evolving the game as if we're making the third part of the series. Brand-new combat system. Hero squads. We're adding many fresh ideas to the genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/6f6deda041830f08ee294ed4f0953bc5.poster.avif?t=1785339330\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/6f6deda041830f08ee294ed4f0953bc5.webm?t=1785339330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you've never played Majesty, you'll love how captivating the gameplay is! You'll be watching this world come to life, and it's hard not to get drawn in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sandbox Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/80ffde6dbdd9a52d8505e2ec2cb1255d.poster.avif?t=1785339330\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/80ffde6dbdd9a52d8505e2ec2cb1255d.webm?t=1785339330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/80ffde6dbdd9a52d8505e2ec2cb1255d.mp4?t=1785339330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your kingdom with total freedom in a mode where you fight against computer-controlled opponents in 1vs1 duels or 1vs3 skirmishes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-development with players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/43a901f8b0abf7c3d3578044084ab190.poster.avif?t=1785339330\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2461280/extras/43a901f8b0abf7c3d3578044084ab190.webm?t=1785339330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We regularly conduct playtests, gather feedback, and implement exciting ideas. This makes the game even more engaging and full of interesting features.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7,8,10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 14 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7,8,10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 14 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","RPG","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Rockbee Team"],"publishers":["Polden Publishing"],"release_date":"20 Oct, 2025","metacritic_score":73}